*.pyc
.DS_Store
docs/

# Rust build output. 138 MB of it, none of it source.
#
# The compiled binary is not committed either, deliberately. It is
# platform-specific, and committing one means every other platform gets the
# wrong one. `install.sh` places the binary next to the skill; see
# engine/README.md for how to obtain one for a platform this was not built on.
engine/target/

# CI output dropped into the working tree by hand or by an editor.
# 2,400 lines of runner logs is not a source file, and a fresh clone does not
# need it to pass.
logs.txt